quote":"會理"},{"mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003:m0268","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete","quote":"會理"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"梁書二十九在南康王績傳末明載子會理嗣，十五拜湘州刺史。與王實所任南康嗣王湘州長史相合。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_C","source_assertion_id":"a-nan023-wangying-huili-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","source_id":"s-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context-ws1538079","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context:p001","quote":"績寡玩好，少嗜欲，居無僕妾，躬事約儉，所有租秩，悉寄天府。及薨後，府有南康國無名錢數千萬。","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context:p001:m0000"},{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","source_id":"s-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context-ws1538079","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context:p002","quote":"子會理嗣，字長才。少聰慧，好文史。年十一而孤，特爲高祖所愛，衣服禮秩與正王不殊。年十五，拜輕車將軍、湘州刺史，又領石頭戍軍事。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context:p002:m0001"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原段子某承前段傳主。","human_reviewed":false}},{"id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_CB","label":"蕭通理（字仲宣，祁陽侯）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"通理","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003:m0172","c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p004:m0000","c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0000"]},{"surface":"仲宣","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p004:m0003"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003:m0172","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete","quote":"通理"},{"mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p004:m0000","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p004","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete","quote":"通理"},{"mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p004:m0003","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p004","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete","quote":"仲宣"},{"mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0000","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete","quote":"通理"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"蕭通理（字仲宣，祁陽侯），見本組原文及身份互校。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_C","source_assertion_id":null,"parent_connection":{"type":"shared_father_through_siblings","sibling_assertion_ids":["a-liang029-huili-tongli-brother"],"sibling_father_assertion_id":"a-liang029-huili-nan-father"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-029-huili-complete-ws1538079","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003","quote":"是冬，景往晉熙，景師虛弱，會理復與柳敬禮謀之。敬禮曰：「舉大事必有所資，今無寸兵，安可以動？」會理曰：「湖熟有吾舊兵三千餘人，昨來相知，克期響集，聽吾日定，便至京師。計賊守兵不過千人耳，若大兵外攻，吾等內應，直取王偉，事必有成。縱景後歸，無能爲也。」敬禮曰「善」，因贊成之。于時百姓厭賊，咸思用命，自丹陽至于京口，靡不同之。後事不果，與弟祁陽侯通理並遇害。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003:m0172","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003:m0013","source_assertion_id":"a-liang029-huili-tongli-brother","source_term":"與弟祁陽侯通理"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-053","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-053-huili-paternal","source_id":"s-nanshi-053-huili-paternal-ws1518868","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-053-huili-paternal:p001","quote":"績寡玩好，少嗜欲，居無僕妾，躬事儉約。所有租秩，悉寄天府。及薨後，少府有南康國無名錢數千萬。子會理嗣。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-053-huili-paternal:p001:m0047","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-053-huili-paternal:p001:m0000","source_assertion_id":"a-liang029-huili-nan-father","source_term":"子會理"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"以梁書通理為會理弟及南史會理為績子繫同一父系。"}},{"id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_CC","label":"蕭乂理（字季英，安樂侯）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"乂理","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0003","c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0042","c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0064","c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p002:m0000","c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003:m0009","c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003:m0222","c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003:m0244"]},{"surface":"季英","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0006"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0003","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete","quote":"乂理"},{"mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0006","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete","quote":"季英"},{"mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0042","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete","quote":"乂理"},{"mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0064","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete","quote":"乂理"},{"mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p002:m0000","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p002","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete","quote":"乂理"},{"mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003:m0009","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete","quote":"乂理"},{"mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003:m0222","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete","quote":"乂理"},{"mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003:m0244","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p003","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete","quote":"乂理"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"蕭乂理（字季英，安樂侯），見本組原文及身份互校。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_C","source_assertion_id":"a-liang029-yili-father","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-029-yili-complete-ws1538079","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001","quote":"通理弟乂理字季英，會理第六弟也。生十旬而簡王薨，至三歲而能言，見內人分散，涕泣相送，乂理問其故，或曰：「此簡王宮人，喪畢去爾。」乂理便號泣，悲不自勝，諸宮人見之，莫不傷感，爲之停者三人焉。服闋後，見高祖，又悲泣不自勝。高祖爲之流涕，謂左右曰：「此兒大必爲奇士。」大同八年，封安樂縣侯，邑五百戶。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0003","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0020","source_term":"生十旬而簡王薨"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"承南康簡王子諸傳之嗣與諸子次第，乂理生十旬而簡王卒。"}}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-liangshu-029-huili-complete-ws1538079","work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete","raw_mention_count":3,"mention_ids":["c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003:m0172","c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p004:m0000","c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p004:m0003"],"paragraph_ids":["c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003","c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p004"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003:m0172","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003:m0172"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p004:m0000","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p004:m0000"],"kind":"paragraph"},{"canonical_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p004:m0003","mention_ids":["c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p004:m0003"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":3,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":3,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":2,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"3處獨立位置，3個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"},{"source_id":"s-liangshu-029-yili-complete-ws1538079","work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0000"],"paragraph_ids