事必有成。縱景後歸，無能爲也。」敬禮曰「善」，因贊成之。于時百姓厭賊，咸思用命，自丹陽至于京口，靡不同之。後事不果，與弟祁陽侯通理並遇害。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003:m0172","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003:m0013"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"會理為通理兄，南史同傳反覆見。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"a-liang029-yili-tongli","subject_person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_CC","object_person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_CB","predicate":"brother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"通理弟"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-029-yili-complete-ws1538079","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001","quote":"通理弟乂理字季英，會理第六弟也。生十旬而簡王薨，至三歲而能言，見內人分散，涕泣相送，乂理問其故，或曰：「此簡王宮人，喪畢去爾。」乂理便號泣，悲不自勝，諸宮人見之，莫不傷感，爲之停者三人焉。服闋後，見高祖，又悲泣不自勝。高祖爲之流涕，謂左右曰：「此兒大必爲奇士。」大同八年，封安樂縣侯，邑五百戶。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0003","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0000"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"梁書、南史均作通理弟。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_C","source_assertion_id":null,"parent_connection":{"type":"shared_father_through_siblings","sibling_assertion_ids":["a-liang029-huili-tongli-brother"],"sibling_father_assertion_id":"a-liang029-huili-nan-father"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-029-huili-complete-ws1538079","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003","quote":"是冬，景往晉熙，景師虛弱，會理復與柳敬禮謀之。敬禮曰：「舉大事必有所資，今無寸兵，安可以動？」會理曰：「湖熟有吾舊兵三千餘人，昨來相知，克期響集，聽吾日定，便至京師。計賊守兵不過千人耳，若大兵外攻，吾等內應，直取王偉，事必有成。縱景後歸，無能爲也。」敬禮曰「善」，因贊成之。于時百姓厭賊，咸思用命，自丹陽至于京口，靡不同之。後事不果，與弟祁陽侯通理並遇害。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003:m0172","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003:m0013","source_assertion_id":"a-liang029-huili-tongli-brother","source_term":"與弟祁陽侯通理"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-053","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-053-huili-paternal","source_id":"s-nanshi-053-huili-paternal-ws1518868","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-053-huili-paternal:p001","quote":"績寡玩好，少嗜欲，居無僕妾，躬事儉約。所有租秩，悉寄天府。及薨後，少府有南康國無名錢數千萬。子會理嗣。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-053-huili-paternal:p001:m0047","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-053-huili-paternal:p001:m0000","source_assertion_id":"a-liang029-huili-nan-father","source_term":"子會理"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"以梁書通理為會理弟及南史會理為績子繫同一父系。","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_CB"}],"life_events":[{"id":"le-liang029-huili-joint-death-通理","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_CB","event_type":"death","source_term":"遇害","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003","start":175,"end":177,"surface":"遇害"},"date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-029","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete","source_id":"s-liangshu-029-huili-complete-ws1538079","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003","quote":"是冬，景往晉熙，景師虛弱，會理復與柳敬禮謀之。敬禮曰：「舉大事必有所資，今無寸兵，安可以動？」會理曰：「湖熟有吾舊兵三千餘人，昨來相知，克期響集，聽吾日定，便至京師。計賊守兵不過千人耳，若大兵外攻，吾等內應，直取王偉，事必有成。縱景後歸，無能爲也。」敬禮曰「善」，因贊成之。于時百姓厭賊，咸思用命，自丹陽至于京口，靡不同之。後事不果，與弟祁陽侯通理並遇害。","person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003:m0172"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按同段人物與次第核所屬卒事。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003:m0172","start":172,"end":174,"surface":"通理","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_CB","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p003","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete"},{"id":"c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p004