-huili-complete-ws1538079"},{"id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001","text":"通理弟乂理字季英，會理第六弟也。生十旬而簡王薨，至三歲而能言，見內人分散，涕泣相送，乂理問其故，或曰：「此簡王宮人，喪畢去爾。」乂理便號泣，悲不自勝，諸宮人見之，莫不傷感，爲之停者三人焉。服闋後，見高祖，又悲泣不自勝。高祖爲之流涕，謂左右曰：「此兒大必爲奇士。」大同八年，封安樂縣侯，邑五百戶。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":25,"last_line":25,"raw_start":1388,"raw_end":1542,"raw_character_offsets":[1388,1389,1390,1391,1392,1393,1394,1395,1396,1397,1398,1399,1400,1401,1402,1403,1404,1405,1406,1407,1408,1409,1410,1411,1412,1413,1414,1415,1416,1417,1418,1419,1420,1421,1422,1423,1424,1425,1426,1427,1428,1429,1430,1431,1432,1433,1434,1435,1436,1437,1438,1439,1440,1441,1442,1443,1444,1445,1446,1447,1448,1449,1450,1451,1452,1453,1454,1455,1456,1457,1458,1459,1460,1461,1462,1463,1464,1465,1466,1467,1468,1469,1470,1471,1472,1473,1474,1475,1476,1477,1478,1479,1480,1481,1482,1483,1484,1485,1486,1487,1488,1489,1490,1491,1492,1493,1494,1495,1496,1497,1498,1499,1500,1501,1502,1503,1504,1505,1506,1507,1508,1509,1510,1511,1512,1513,1514,1515,1516,1517,1518,1524,1525,1526,1527,1530,1531,1532,1533,1534,1535,1536,1537,1538,1539,1540,1541],"revision_id":1538079},"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"通理","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_CB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"乂理","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_CC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"季英","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_CC","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"會理","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_CA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-029-yili-complete:p001:m0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"簡王","kind":"person","person_id":"fo7_f8v_rmf_C","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-liangshu-029-yil